OL,3,GNEWSAKiller sold guns to criminals
OL,4,Aafter prison release
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of the men convicted of killing a
OL,7,Fpolice officer started selling guns to
OL,8,Fcriminals across London after being
OL,9,Freleased from prison, a court heard.
OL,11,FFaisal Razzaq was jailed in 2006 for
OL,12,Fmanslaughter, having acted as the
OL,13,Fgetaway driver in a robbery which ended
OL,14,Fin PC Sharon Beshenivsky being shot
OL,15,Fdead in Bradford, West Yorkshire.
OL,17,FHe was released on parole in 2017 after
OL,18,Fserving 11 years, and started obtaining
OL,19,Fguns and selling them to criminal
OL,20,Fcustomers while living in Edgware,
OL,21,Fnorth London.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
