OL,3,GNEWSAKiller sold guns to criminals
OL,4,Aafter prison release
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe is one of six people to be sentenced
OL,7,Flater this month at Harrow Crown Court
OL,8,Ffor involvement in a firearms
OL,9,Fconspiracy.
